  "remarks": "JSC Investtorgbank is a Russian commercial bank headquarted in Moscow. The bank is a part of the TKB (Transkapitalbank) Banking Group. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, JSC Investtorgbank is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
